{"id":"4f1bcc0d6bb86201","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-simultaneous-substitution.md","title":"Simultaneous Substitution","display":"df-simultaneous-substitution — Simultaneous Substitution","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-simultaneous-substitution","aliases":["57-df-simultaneous-substitution"],"display":"df-simultaneous-substitution — Simultaneous Substitution","depends_on":["[[57-df-substitution]]","[[57-df-substitution-application]]","[[57-df-substitution-formula]]","[[57-df-formula]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-simultaneous-substitution"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-simultaneous-substitution</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-simultaneous-substitution — Simultaneous Substitution"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d1b845cf0812591a\" href=\"?note=d1b845cf0812591a\" title=\"57-df-substitution\">57-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fcdd3e992e132d58\" href=\"?note=fcdd3e992e132d58\" title=\"57-df-substitution-application\">57-df-substitution-application</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"237ed61a00bb9297\" href=\"?note=237ed61a00bb9297\" title=\"57-df-substitution-formula\">57-df-substitution-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"76e02a8ebe51f748\" href=\"?note=76e02a8ebe51f748\" title=\"57-df-formula\">57-df-formula</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta=\\{(x_i,t_i):1\\le i\\le n\\}\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\">\\(\\theta=\\{(x_i,t_i):1\\le i\\le n\\}\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d1b845cf0812591a\" href=\"?note=d1b845cf0812591a\" title=\"57-df-substitution\">57-df-substitution</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(x\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\circ\\in\\{\\lor,\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\">\\(\\circ\\in\\{\\lor,\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}\\)</span>。原子应用见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"fcdd3e992e132d58\" href=\"?note=fcdd3e992e132d58\" title=\"57-df-substitution-application\">57-df-substitution-application</a>；单变量操作见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"237ed61a00bb9297\" href=\"?note=237ed61a00bb9297\" title=\"57-df-substitution-formula\">57-df-substitution-formula</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\neg\\varphi)\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\varphi\\theta),\\\\\n(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq(\\varphi\\theta)\\circ(\\psi\\theta),\\\\\n(Qx\\varphi)\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq Qx\\bigl(\\varphi(\\theta\\setminus(\\{x\\}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\varphi[t_1/x_1,\\ldots,t_n/x_n]&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi\\theta.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n(\\neg\\varphi)\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq\\neg(\\varphi\\theta),\\\\\n(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq(\\varphi\\theta)\\circ(\\psi\\theta),\\\\\n(Qx\\varphi)\\theta&amp;\\coloneqq Qx\\bigl(\\varphi(\\theta\\setminus(\\{x\\}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\varphi[t_1/x_1,\\ldots,t_n/x_n]&amp;\\coloneqq\\varphi\\theta.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\quad\\varphi\\{(x,t)\\}=\\varphi[t/x].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\quad\\varphi\\{(x,t)\\}=\\varphi[t/x].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原子分支由代换应用定义继承；量词下删除被绑定变量的代换条目，不改名，因此与本册单变量操作一致。不是按某个未指定次序依次替换。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"d1b845cf0812591a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"fcdd3e992e132d58","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substitution-application]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"237ed61a00bb9297","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-substitution-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"d1b845cf0812591a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta=\\{(x_i,t_i):1\\le i\\le n\\}\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S$，见 [[57-df-substitution]]；$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$、$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$、$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$、$\\circ\\in\\{\\lor,\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}$。原子应用见 [[57-df-substitution-application]]；单变量操作见 [[57-df-substitution-formula]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substitution-application","status":"resolved","id":"fcdd3e992e132d58","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta=\\{(x_i,t_i):1\\le i\\le n\\}\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S$，见 [[57-df-substitution]]；$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$、$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$、$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$、$\\circ\\in\\{\\lor,\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}$。原子应用见 [[57-df-substitution-application]]；单变量操作见 [[57-df-substitution-formula]]。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-substitution-formula","status":"resolved","id":"237ed61a00bb9297","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta=\\{(x_i,t_i):1\\le i\\le n\\}\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S$，见 [[57-df-substitution]]；$\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$、$\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S$、$x\\in\\mathrm{Var}$，$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$、$\\circ\\in\\{\\lor,\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}$。原子应用见 [[57-df-substitution-application]]；单变量操作见 [[57-df-substitution-formula]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\theta=\\{(x_i,t_i):1\\le i\\le n\\}\\in\\mathrm{Subst}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{AtFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\circ\\in\\{\\lor,\\land,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n(\\neg\\varphi)\\theta&\\coloneqq\\neg(\\varphi\\theta),\\\\\n(\\varphi\\circ\\psi)\\theta&\\coloneqq(\\varphi\\theta)\\circ(\\psi\\theta),\\\\\n(Qx\\varphi)\\theta&\\coloneqq Qx\\bigl(\\varphi(\\theta\\setminus(\\{x\\}\\times\\mathrm{Term}_S))\\bigr),\\\\\n\\varphi[t_1/x_1,\\ldots,t_n/x_n]&\\coloneqq\\varphi\\theta.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\quad\\varphi\\{(x,t)\\}=\\varphi[t/x].","display":true}],"bytes":1384,"backlinks":[{"id":"43b2728e68e05836","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"对每个输入及每个 $i\\in\\operatorname{ran}(\\vec e)$，固定互异的新符号 $F_{\\varphi,i}\\notin S$，元数 $r_i=|\\vec z|+|\\vec y_i|$；$r_i=0$ 时为常量。此整个符号选择族是算法环境参数。同时代入见 [[57-df-simultaneous-substitution]]，有限全称前缀见 [[57-df-universal-closure]]。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-176","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contract-left]]\n[[57-df-contract-right]]\n[[57-df-creative]]\n[[57-df-cut-sequent]]\n[[57-df-decidable-theory]]\n[[57-df-definite-program]]\n[[57-df-derivable]]\n[[57-df-derivation]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-dlo]]\n[[57-df-dnf]]\n[[57-df-domain]]\n[[57-df-dovf]]\n[[57-df-dovf-signature]]\n[[57-df-downward-LS-property]]\n[[57-df-dpll]]\n[[57-df-ef-game]]\n[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[57-df-elementary-substructure]]\n[[57-df-emptyset]]\n[[57-df-endomorphism-algebra]]\n[[57-df-equality-left]]\n[[57-df-equality-right]]\n[[57-df-equiv-left]]\n[[57-df-equiv-right]]\n[[57-df-existential-left]]\n[[57-df-existential-right]]\n[[57-df-existential-variable]]\n[[57-df-exists-left]]\n[[57-df-exists-right]]\n[[57-df-explicit-definability]]\n[[57-df-family]]\n[[57-df-field]